": "532332858344340", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566679_532332861677673_8611984530213389076_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dtZzU1YtQTQQ7kNvwHMhzUS&_nc_oc=AdoWjhGdka8tiiQQa7xouqn4mG1IZPxgQxgGGfP8fbBJqEa7uCvR5-Rw-VjfuB1-bZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2l9AJm_lOww7W3pHDlYzCPiuwCsqV_4T3_JRynBYruoQ&oe=69F36E17"}, {"file_name": "ImmersiveLogo-Store-556x164.png", "id": "502086255171574", "image_type": "APP_IMG_IMMERSIVE_LAYER_LOGO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974905_502086258504907_6349727471447871497_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j0wb4_ohB9UQ7kNvwFgbAq-&_nc_oc=AdqJN8_D_7D0tNqlC2ibSoyyOiRLW9P4qViK4V5sEyKsEv1h6y5-WjcinB8D3iCbG2I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1vQYk9PawQt3RGBIAs_K-PzhSqt2-6vPkJHt1YVxmvAw&oe=69F3530F"}]}, "id": "2048772769385220", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Evolving- 2560x1440px (1).png", "id": "992225546820422", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303971_992225550153755_6304991321399602723_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FCJR_XpkP9sQ7kNvwHiTfck&_nc_oc=AdplyLxBqlic-2SerPjEVJZwwxdiFKTLbIn_0zvFjZYz5u93SKSPSLiHZMldVbhTFr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0PJQ4EraP6c_o1TAQXevycxen9dm4oGrjz2SGncL5wkQ&oe=69F36029"}, {"file_name": "POV PSG 2560.png", "id": "9029051807222287", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393145_9029051820555619_4001845540677160740_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dZfmoa4qaMMQ7kNvwHYYCZL&_nc_oc=AdrZci2knf9fy0wxHV5z-7kHOHg6SMdj5g7J37zv6Iai77csHkpZKF9Qumj6tR7J6I0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2jS3_8vb3TBBBRgSAevcZkO1dnk11RCkIcQJSpPHSsRg&oe=69F36BF9"}, {"file_name": "PDP-NEW-SCREENSHOT.png", "id": "556100030893784", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507818746_556100034227117_101470528984695951_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LX_WVm9fFF8Q7kNvwFKaec_&_nc_oc=Adosu0e6dcqCn3MH7BqOnZjN3EIL03Ybi-nPgEwixLjrBD5O3vmmq9IIIbaAailv5Y4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af36M4zio_bwzXawhJ9AH2UCSMxydqFKqaqHXF-5SucEUg&oe=69F34394"}, {"file_name": "Watch Party Xtadium 2.png", "id": "833751395784264", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304952_833751402450930_847745436912682175_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GApmYHMtn0IQ7kNvwG3qSHh&_nc_oc=AdrOoSH1hJkCb7aeTAXsAhdgmvulW1cCCuJvbMdRFV8BMPprfNP2L6xX-a4a-OYik3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0UJPZrSzS1bgUOKd6_ui0zrg-Q7JevTV8GUueHO4L1yA&oe=69F356B6"}, {"file_name": "Watch Party Xtadium 3.png", "id": "1620472099172242", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310720_1620472102505575_3164712617509391571_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P7O9JD9Uo_wQ7kNvwHmyF5H&_nc_oc=AdpqH0JNYhmijoS5TDKagu5wgf3POs_loY9tNzg4T_BfOctkj7cWt_BfhB1uClVP-MQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af05SMitFt3jDiaZAgIsKBK6r165_qO3w9s08P-3niKMZw&oe=69F36E0B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Xtadium Hero.png", "id": "1513127173570823", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305194_1513127176904156_1330446897711324522_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L_j_5NOeXjEQ7kNvwEi7H4t&_nc_oc=AdqRYlj9k_r_1gvyDWZBIPttHEWrc6ImRwaWA4G5vOTGrHSiQ3jJx3nLCcWndKQUbSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3TD3-6ac8j3MLsM3mo1lJlannfWSucQN9hEkLHE_av2A&oe=69F35653"}, "display_name": "Xtadium Immersive Sports", "keywords": ["stadium", "sports", "manchester", "mancity", "soccer"], "long_description": "**Soccer, from the inside.**\n\nWith Xtadium, you are no longer watching from the outside. You get an inside view.\n\nNow featuring Manchester City, Xtadium brings you closer to the people, places, and moments that define matchday, without needing a ticket.\n\nExplore City Space, where you can:\n\n- Walk through the Etihad Stadium, from the tunnel to the pitch and more\n- Step into exclusive spaces.\n- Experience the energy around matchday through fans and atmosphere\n- Get closer to the Club through exclusive behind-the-scenes moments\n\nBeyond Manchester City, Xtadium offers a growing library of immersive sports experiences from leading clubs, leagues, and global events, designed to bring you closer to the emotion and environment of sport.\n\n**Key Features**\n- Manchester City, Behind the scenes: Go beyond the stands and get an inside view of City.\n- Immersive Stadium Access: Walk through iconic spaces at the Etihad Stadium.\n- Feel the Atmosphere: Experience fans, energy, and matchday build-up from within the environment.\n- First-Person 180\u00ba Viewing: See moments from perspectives you cannot access in real life.\n- Expanding Content Library: New immersive experiences and highlights added over time.\n\n**Why Xtadium**\n\nBecause access changes everything.\n\nXtadium transforms sport into something you can step inside. With Manchester City, that means getting closer to the Club in a way that was never possible before.\n\nDownload Xtadium today on Meta Quest and step inside!\n \nxtadiumvr.com | @XtadiumVR\n{2734649323570950}", "short_description": "Step inside Manchester City and experience the Club from the tunnel, the pitch, and beyond in immersive VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xtadium icon.png", "id": "26388453830776116", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307311_26388453837442782_8864360868123682352_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sUzI4k_EzkkQ7kNvwFlR8K-&_nc_oc=AdqbMC25U4sV3cIpLDukON3k1Vwi2bBa27mqnsQfEjx_uCTN57brvTkGcnKpH7kvOac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00